+  claire watchdog              start whatever has died, unless you stopped
+                               the desk yourself (for a timer; silent when
+                               all is well)
   claire live status|setup|arm|disarm|limits
                                the REAL-MONEY Saxo switch — off by default
   claire legs-backfill [--dry-run] [--yes]
